            <content type="1" mime_type="content/term" content_visibility="false" file_name=""><![CDATA[Angles with respectively parallel sides are either equal (if both of them are either acute or obtuse), or their sum is equal to 180° (if one of them is acute, but the other one is obtuse).]]></content>
